---
import { HiArrowRight } from "react-icons/hi";
---

<section class="relative flex items-center justify-center px-4 pt-16">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <div class="h-[450px] w-full rounded-full bg-[#7836cf]/5"></div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col-reverse items-stretch gap-6 md:flex-row"
  >

    <div
      class="bg-gray-900 border-none flex w-full flex-col justify-center rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-lg md:w-2/3 drop-shadow-[4px_4px_0_#7836cf]"
    >
      <h2 class="text-white text-4xl font-bold drop-shadow-[2px_2px_0_#7836cf]">
        About me
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">
        IT Support professional with experience providing remote and on-site technical support, troubleshooting hardware and software issues, and assisting end users in educational environments. Experience as a Technical Assistant for a Data Analytics Bootcamp, supporting students with Python, SQL, Power BI, and Tableau while developing knowledge in data analysis and visualization. Additional background supporting audiovisual technologies and production systems, combining strong technical troubleshooting, analytical thinking, and effective communication. International experience living and studying in the United States and Spain, with bilingual communication skills and adaptability to multicultural, fast-paced environments.
      </p>

      <a
        href="/about"
        class="group mt-4 inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold transition-all"
      >
        Ver más sobre mí
        <HiArrowRight
          className="ml-1 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          size={18}
        />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
